Date: Mon, 16 Nov 2026 00:31:39 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] Lapin UX: Explorer in light mode: white file area, 32 px
 rows, flat search box, wider tabs

Matches the light-mode reference (Refs #143): the command bar, files and
status bar sit on a plain white layer below the tabs and address row; the
details pane is light grey; rows are 32 px with 16 px icons and no lines
between them; the search box is the same lightly rounded box as the
address; tabs are 240 px and shrink when there are too many; the open
place in the pane is a soft grey box; Recents is no longer in the pane
(recent files are on Home). COSMIC's own session is unchanged.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_016CkhomYUp7uVySJk724Amq
